      "username": "The_Justifier",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-07-13T11:39:35.472Z",
      "cooked": "<p>A pretty standard, which means satisfying, Omnitron experience (he really is one of the better designed villains in his tough-but-unfair fashion).  Most remarkable for the fact that I played both Tachyon and Visionary against him completely normally, not stacking his deck and not redirecting the Electro-Pulse Explosive, which I actually had to take seriously (like various Drones and Mummies, it ended up dying in the Spike Trap).</p>",
