      "created_at": "2022-07-14T21:08:56.259Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Hankroyd\" data-post=\"8\" data-topic=\"29483\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/cc9497/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Hankroyd:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Once happy, Guise went Santa for the end of the game.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>What!?  <em><strong>WHY!?!?!?</strong></em> Santa Guise is so incredibly slow to do anything useful compared to the base version.  It’s not exactly a Tough Choice which version you should use, particularly around heroes that don’t grant a lot of extra powers.</p>",
