    {
      "id": 246406,
      "name": "Hankroyd",
      "username": "Hankroyd",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/cc9497/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2022-07-14T21:42:05.247Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I … I like Santa Guise. Don’t judge me !!!</p>\n<p>The game was more or less already won thanks to Dark Visionary. And I love how Santa Guise brings presents and happiness to other Heroes.<br>\nI love playing ‘I can do that too’ on his first power : I imagine the other heroes watching him and thinking “What are you bragging about ? Of course you can do that, that is your own stupid power”</p>\n<p>When I got Completionnist Guise in a game, my purpose with him is to get all the variants from other heroes under him then turn him Santa. Yeah … I know, not the optimal strategy. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>Here I took on myself and just got the team I wanted before Santa-ing him.</p>",
      "post_number": 10,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2022-07-14T21:42:05.247Z",
